{%- comment -%} Founder story, Emmalee Fitton, The Skin Bay (brand-styled port of headless meet-the-founder) {%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign booking = 'https://mediprodirect.book.app/book-now/availability?services=W3sicyI6MTUxMzM2MH1d' -%}
<section class="fs" data-section-id="{{ section.id }}">

  {%- comment -%} HERO {%- endcomment -%}
  <div class="fs-hero">
    <div class="fs-hero-inner">
      <img class="fs-photo" src="{{ 'email-founder-emmalee.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Emmalee Fitton, Founder of The Skin Bay" width="160" height="160" loading="eager">
      <p class="fs-eyebrow fs-vh">The Skin Bay Founder</p>
      <img class="fs-banner" src="{{ 'founderstory-h-hero.png' | asset_url }}" alt="Hey, I'm Emmalee Fitton">
      <h1 class="fs-title fs-vh">Hey, I&rsquo;m <span class="fs-script">Emmalee</span> Fitton</h1>
      <p class="fs-lede">Here&rsquo;s my background, and how I ended up starting The Skin Bay. SkinCeuticals European Master Physician, founder of The Skin Bay and <a href="https://www.mediproaesthetics.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Medipro Aesthetics</a>. Trained by the labs, trusted by the skin.</p>
      <div class="fs-cta-row">
        <a class="fs-btn fs-btn-dark" href="{{ booking }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Book a Consultation</a>
        <a class="fs-btn fs-btn-ghost" href="#fs-story">Read My Story</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  {%- comment -%} CERTIFICATIONS {%- endcomment -%}
  <div class="fs-certs">
    <div class="fs-certs-inner">
      <div class="fs-certs-head">
        <p class="fs-eyebrow fs-eyebrow-light">The Receipts</p>
        <img class="fs-ibanner" src="{{ 'founder-h-certified.png' | asset_url }}" alt="Certified, accredited &amp; brand-trained">
        <h2 class="fs-h2 fs-h2-light fs-vh">Certified, accredited &amp; <span class="fs-script">brand-trained</span></h2>
        <p class="fs-certs-sub">CPD-certified training direct from the labs that make the products, continuously renewed. Tap any certificate to view in full.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="fs-cert-carousel">
        <button class="fs-arrow fs-prev" type="button" aria-label="Previous" data-dir="-1">&#8249;</button>
        <div class="fs-cert-track" data-track>
          {%- assign certs = 'founder-cert4.webp::European Master Physician::SkinCeuticals::Oct 2023,founder-cert1.webp::Master Physician, UK::SkinCeuticals::Sep 2022,founder-cert5.webp::Antioxidant Science::Prof Mark Birch-Machin::Mar 2024,founder-cert3.webp::Skin Health::SkinCeuticals MLL::Aug 2023,founder-cert2.webp::Acne Pathologies::SkinCeuticals MLL::May 2023,founder-cert6.webp::MASCED PRO, Skin Cancer Detection::SKCIN · Endorsed by BAD::Aug 2020' | split: ',' -%}
          {%- for c in certs -%}
            {%- assign p = c | split: '::' -%}
            {%- assign img = p[0] | asset_url -%}
            <button class="fs-cert" type="button" data-full="{{ img }}" data-title="{{ p[1] | escape }}" data-meta="{{ p[2] | escape }} · {{ p[3] }}">
              <span class="fs-cert-img"><img src="{{ img }}" alt="{{ p[1] | escape }}, {{ p[2] | escape }}" loading="lazy"></span>
              <span class="fs-cert-body"><span class="fs-cert-title">{{ p[1] }}</span><span class="fs-cert-meta">{{ p[2] }}</span><span class="fs-cert-date">{{ p[3] }}</span></span>
            </button>
          {%- endfor -%}
        </div>
        <button class="fs-arrow fs-next" type="button" aria-label="Next" data-dir="1">&#8250;</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  {%- comment -%} STORY {%- endcomment -%}
  <div class="fs-story" id="fs-story">
    <div class="fs-story-media">
      <img src="{{ 'founder-emmalee.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="Emmalee Fitton at the SkinCeuticals European Master Physician event" loading="lazy">
    </div>
    <div class="fs-story-text">
      <p class="fs-eyebrow">The Skin Bay Story</p>
      <img class="fs-ibanner fs-ibanner-left" src="{{ 'founder-h-why.png' | asset_url }}" alt="Why I started The Skin Bay">
      <h2 class="fs-h2 fs-vh">Why I started <span class="fs-script">The Skin Bay</span></h2>
      <p class="fs-drop">TheSkinBay.co.uk was born from a genuine passion for helping people feel confident in their own skin. Throughout my career I&rsquo;ve seen how much skin concerns can affect a person&rsquo;s confidence, wellbeing and quality of life. I wanted to create more than just an online skincare store, I wanted to build a trusted destination where people could access clinically proven products, honest advice and expert guidance without feeling overwhelmed or misled.</p>
      <p>My drive has always come from wanting to make a difference. I&rsquo;ve spent years studying skin health, treating patients and seeing the incredible impact the right routine can have. Now I get to bring that knowledge to people across the UK, helping you achieve healthier skin through evidence-based, clinically proven routines and proper professional support.</p>
      <p>One of the reasons I feel so passionately about what I do is because there&rsquo;s so much misinformation online. Every day I see people with serious skin conditions being encouraged on social media to use beef tallow, coconut oil and countless other trends that have little or no scientific evidence behind them. For someone struggling with acne, rosacea, pigmentation or a compromised skin barrier, this can make their condition <em>significantly</em> worse.</p>
      <p class="fs-strong">Skin health deserves better than viral trends and guesswork.</p>
      <p>What I love most about this industry is the way it brings together science, innovation and genuine patient care. There&rsquo;s always something new to learn and new ways to improve outcomes. But most importantly, I love the confidence it gives people, seeing someone whose skin has improved, whose self-esteem has returned, and who finally feels comfortable in their own skin. That&rsquo;s what inspires me every single day.</p>
      <p class="fs-sign-name">Emmalee</p>
      <p class="fs-sign-role">Founder &middot; The Skin Bay</p>
      <div class="fs-badges"><span>&#10003; Brand-trained</span><span>&#10003; Not brand-loyal</span><span>&#10003; Results-driven</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  {%- comment -%} MEDIPRO SISTER CLINIC {%- endcomment -%}
  <div class="fs-medipro">
    <div class="fs-medipro-inner">
      <p class="fs-eyebrow fs-eyebrow-light">Sister Clinic &middot; Est. 2015</p>
      <img class="fs-medipro-logo" src="{{ 'medipro-logo.png' | asset_url }}" alt="Medipro Aesthetics" loading="lazy">
      <img class="fs-ibanner" src="{{ 'founder-h-more.png' | asset_url }}" alt="Want more than skincare? Step into the clinic.">
      <h2 class="fs-h2 fs-h2-light fs-vh">Want more than skincare? <span class="fs-script">Step into the clinic.</span></h2>
      <p class="fs-medipro-sub">Emmalee&rsquo;s home clinic is <strong>Medipro Aesthetics</strong>, an advanced medical aesthetics studio with a 5.0&#9733; Google rating, delivering non-surgical rejuvenation since 2015. The Skin Bay&rsquo;s professional credibility starts here.</p>
      <div class="fs-treat-grid">
        {%- assign tr = 'HydraFacial::Deep cleanse, exfoliation & hydration in one. Instant glow.||Laser Hair Removal::Medical-grade Cutera laser, safe on all skin types.||Dermal Fillers::Premium HA fillers for natural volume and contour.||Anti-Wrinkle::Precision injections to soften lines and prevent new ones.||Profhilo::Bio-remodelling injectable that stimulates collagen.||Chemical Peels::Medical-grade resurfacing for pigmentation and tone.||Skin Remodelling::Polynucleotides for texture, tone and long-term quality.||MASCED Skin Checks::Certified early detection for melanoma and skin cancer.' | split: '||' -%}
        {%- for t in tr -%}{%- assign tp = t | split: '::' -%}
          <div class="fs-treat-card"><span class="fs-treat-name">{{ tp[0] }}</span><span class="fs-treat-desc">{{ tp[1] }}</span></div>
        {%- endfor -%}
      </div>
      <div class="fs-creds">
        {%- assign cr = 'SkinCeuticals Specialist,Cutera Laser,4t Medical CPD,MASCED Certified' | split: ',' -%}
        {%- for c in cr -%}<span class="fs-cred">{{ c }}</span>{%- endfor -%}
      </div>
      <a class="fs-btn fs-btn-outline-light" href="https://www.mediproaesthetics.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Visit Medipro Aesthetics</a>
      <p class="fs-medipro-note">5.0&#9733; Google &middot; Est. 2015 &middot; Non-surgical aesthetics</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  {%- comment -%} PULL QUOTE {%- endcomment -%}
  <div class="fs-quote">
    <p class="fs-quote-text">&ldquo;Honest, brand-trained advice, given by someone who actually <span class="fs-script">treats skin</span> every week.&rdquo;</p>
    <p class="fs-quote-attr">, Emmalee Fitton, Founder</p>
  </div>

  {%- comment -%} FINAL CTA {%- endcomment -%}
  <div class="fs-final">
    <p class="fs-eyebrow fs-eyebrow-light">Work With Emmalee</p>
    <img class="fs-ibanner" src="{{ 'founder-h-routine.png' | asset_url }}" alt="One conversation away from the right routine.">
    <h2 class="fs-h2 fs-h2-light fs-vh">One conversation away from <span class="fs-script">the right routine.</span></h2>
    <p class="fs-final-sub">£20 to book, fully redeemable against any product you buy on the day. Essentially free. Always honest.</p>
    <div class="fs-cta-row fs-cta-center">
      <a class="fs-btn fs-btn-light" href="{{ booking }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Book a Consultation</a>
      <a class="fs-btn fs-btn-ghost-light" href="/pages/about-us">About The Skin Bay</a>
    </div>
  </div>

</section>

{%- comment -%} LIGHTBOX {%- endcomment -%}
<div class="fs-lightbox" data-lightbox hidden>
  <button class="fs-lb-close" type="button" aria-label="Close">&times;</button>
  <div class="fs-lb-inner"><img data-lb-img src="" alt=""><p class="fs-lb-cap"><span data-lb-title></span><br><span data-lb-meta></span></p></div>
</div>

<style>
  .fs{background:#fff;color:#141414;}
  .fs-banner{display:block;width:100%;max-width:680px;height:auto;margin:0 auto 22px;}
  .fs-ibanner{display:block;width:100%;max-width:680px;height:auto;margin:0 auto 8px;}
  .fs-ibanner-left{max-width:680px;margin:0 0 8px;}
  .fs-vh{position:absolute!important;width:1px;height:1px;padding:0;margin:-1px;overflow:hidden;clip:rect(0 0 0 0);white-space:nowrap;border:0;}
  .fs-eyebrow{font-family:var(--font-body--family), sans-serif;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.24em;font-size:11px;color:#8a8377;margin:0 0 10px;}
  .fs-eyebrow-light{color:#c9bfae;}
  .fs-script{font-family:var(--font-heading--family), serif;font-weight:700;}
  .fs-h2{font-family:var(--font-heading--family), serif;font-weight:500;font-size:clamp(28px,4vw,44px);line-height:1.08;margin:0 0 6px;}
  .fs-h2-light{color:#fff;}
  .fs-btn{display:inline-block;font-family:var(--font-body--family), sans-serif;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;text-decoration:none;padding:15px 34px;border-radius:999px;transition:all .25s ease;}
  .fs-btn-dark{background:#141414;color:#fff;} .fs-btn-dark:hover{opacity:.85;}
  .fs-btn-ghost{border:1px solid #141414;color:#141414;} .fs-btn-ghost:hover{background:#141414;color:#fff;}
  .fs-btn-light{background:#fff;color:#141414;} .fs-btn-light:hover{background:#EADED0;}
  .fs-btn-ghost-light{border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.4);color:#fff;} .fs-btn-ghost-light:hover{background:#fff;color:#141414;}
  .fs-btn-outline-light{border:1px solid #c9a04e;color:#f5efe1;} .fs-btn-outline-light:hover{background:#c9a04e;color:#3f4a3d;}
  .fs-cta-row{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:14px;margin-top:26px;}
  .fs-cta-center{justify-content:center;}
  /* hero */
  .fs-hero{background:#F9F3ED;text-align:center;padding:60px 24px;}
  .fs-hero-inner{max-width:680px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;}
  .fs-photo{width:160px;height:160px;border-radius:50%;object-fit:cover;box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.14);margin-bottom:24px;}
  .fs-title{font-family:var(--font-heading--family), serif;font-weight:500;font-size:clamp(32px,5vw,52px);line-height:1.05;margin:0 0 16px;}
  .fs-lede{font-family:var(--font-body--family), sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.65;color:#4d4840;max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;}
  .fs-lede a{color:#141414;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px;}
  .fs-stats{display:flex;gap:0;border:1px solid #e4dccf;margin:30px 0 4px;width:100%;max-width:460px;}
  .fs-stat{flex:1;padding:16px 8px;border-right:1px solid #e4dccf;}
  .fs-stat:last-child{border-right:0;}
  .fs-stat-n{display:block;font-family:var(--font-heading--family), serif;font-size:26px;color:#141414;}
  .fs-stat-l{display:block;font-family:var(--font-body--family), sans-serif;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8a8377;margin-top:4px;}
  /* story */
  .fs-story{max-width:760px;margin:0 auto;padding:64px 24px;}
  .fs-story-media img{width:100%;max-width:560px;border-radius:8px;display:block;margin:0 auto 36px;}
  .fs-story-text p{font-family:var(--font-body--family), sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;color:#4d4840;margin:0 0 18px;}
  .fs-strong{color:#141414!important;font-weight:600;font-size:16px!important;}
  .fs-sign-name{font-family:var(--font-heading--family), serif!important;font-weight:700;font-size:30px!important;color:#141414!important;margin:8px 0 0!important;}
  .fs-sign-role{font-family:var(--font-body--family), sans-serif;font-size:10px!important;letter-spacing:.24em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8a8377!important;margin:2px 0 0!important;}
  .fs-badges{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:16px;margin-top:22px;font-family:var(--font-body--family), sans-serif;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8a8377;}
  /* certs */
  .fs-certs{background:#141414;color:#fff;padding:64px 0;}
  .fs-certs-inner{max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 24px;}
  .fs-certs-head{text-align:center;max-width:620px;margin:0 auto 40px;}
  .fs-certs-sub{font-family:var(--font-body--family), sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:rgba(255,255,255,.6);margin-top:12px;}
  .fs-cert-carousel{position:relative;}
  .fs-cert-track{display:flex;gap:20px;overflow-x:auto;scroll-snap-type:x mandatory;scroll-behavior:smooth;padding:2px;scrollbar-width:none;}
  .fs-cert-track::-webkit-scrollbar{display:none;}
  .fs-cert{flex:0 0 300px;scroll-snap-align:start;background:rgba(255,255,255,.03);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);text-align:left;cursor:pointer;padding:0;transition:border-color .3s;}
  .fs-cert:hover{border-color:#EADED0;}
  .fs-cert-img{display:block;aspect-ratio:4/3;overflow:hidden;background:rgba(255,255,255,.05);}
  .fs-cert-img img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;transition:transform 1s ease;}
  .fs-cert:hover .fs-cert-img img{transform:scale(1.05);}
  .fs-cert-body{display:block;padding:16px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1);}
  .fs-cert-title{display:block;font-family:var(--font-heading--family), serif;font-size:15px;color:#fff;line-height:1.25;}
  .fs-cert-meta{display:block;font-family:var(--font-body--family), sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.5);margin-top:4px;}
  .fs-cert-date{display:block;font-family:var(--font-body--family), sans-serif;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#c9bfae;margin-top:6px;}
  .fs-arrow{position:absolute;top:36%;transform:translateY(-50%);z-index:3;width:42px;height:42px;border-radius:50%;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.3);background:#141414;color:#fff;font-size:22px;cursor:pointer;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;}
  .fs-arrow:hover{background:#fff;color:#141414;}
  .fs-prev{left:-10px;} .fs-next{right:-10px;}
  /* medipro */
  .fs-medipro{background:#3f4a3d;color:#f5efe1;text-align:center;padding:64px 24px;}
  .fs-medipro-inner{max-width:960px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;}
  .fs-medipro .fs-eyebrow-light{color:#c9a04e;}
  .fs-medipro .fs-script{color:#e8c87a;}
  .fs-medipro-logo{height:60px;width:auto;margin:8px 0 18px;filter:brightness(0) invert(1);opacity:.95;}
  .fs-medipro-sub{font-family:var(--font-body--family), sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;color:rgba(245,239,225,.8);margin:6px 0 28px;max-width:660px;}
  .fs-medipro-sub strong{color:#e8c87a;}
  .fs-treat-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:1px;background:rgba(201,160,78,.25);border:1px solid rgba(201,160,78,.3);width:100%;margin:0 0 24px;}
  .fs-treat-card{background:#3f4a3d;padding:20px 16px;text-align:left;}
  .fs-treat-name{display:block;font-family:var(--font-heading--family), serif;font-size:15px;color:#f5efe1;margin-bottom:6px;}
  .fs-treat-desc{display:block;font-family:var(--font-body--family), sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;color:rgba(245,239,225,.7);}
  .fs-creds{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:10px;width:100%;margin-bottom:30px;}
  .fs-cred{padding:11px 6px;border:1px solid rgba(201,160,78,.35);color:#e8c87a;font-family:var(--font-body--family), sans-serif;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;background:rgba(255,255,255,.02);}
  .fs-medipro-note{font-family:var(--font-body--family), sans-serif;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:rgba(232,200,122,.75);margin-top:16px;}
  /* quote */
  .fs-quote{background:#F9F3ED;text-align:center;padding:64px 24px;}
  .fs-quote-text{font-family:var(--font-heading--family), serif;font-size:clamp(22px,3vw,34px);line-height:1.2;color:#141414;max-width:820px;margin:0 auto;}
  .fs-quote-attr{font-family:var(--font-body--family), sans-serif;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.24em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#8a8377;margin-top:20px;}
  /* final */
  .fs-final{background:#141414;color:#fff;text-align:center;padding:64px 24px;}
  .fs-final .fs-h2,.fs-final .fs-eyebrow{}
  .fs-final-sub{font-family:var(--font-body--family), sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:rgba(255,255,255,.7);max-width:520px;margin:14px auto 0;}
  .fs-final .fs-cta-row{max-width:520px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;}
  /* lightbox */
  .fs-lightbox{position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:9999;background:rgba(15,15,15,.95);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:24px;}
  .fs-lightbox[hidden]{display:none;}
  .fs-lb-inner{max-width:900px;width:100%;text-align:center;}
  .fs-lb-inner img{max-width:100%;max-height:78vh;object-fit:contain;box-shadow:0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.5);}
  .fs-lb-cap{color:#fff;font-family:var(--font-heading--family), serif;font-size:20px;margin-top:16px;}
  .fs-lb-cap [data-lb-meta]{font-family:var(--font-body--family), sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.6);}
  .fs-lb-close{position:absolute;top:20px;right:22px;width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(255,255,255,.1);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.25);color:#fff;font-size:26px;cursor:pointer;}
  @media (max-width:899px){
    .fs-story{padding:48px 20px;}
    .fs-story-media img{max-width:420px;margin:0 auto 28px;}
    .fs-cert{flex:0 0 78%;}
    .fs-arrow{display:none;}
    .fs-treat-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);}
    .fs-creds{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);}
  }
</style>

<script>
  (function(){
    var root=document.querySelector('.fs[data-section-id="{{ section.id }}"]');
    if(!root){return;}
    root.querySelectorAll('.fs-cert-carousel').forEach(function(c){
      var track=c.querySelector('[data-track]');
      c.querySelectorAll('.fs-arrow').forEach(function(btn){
        btn.addEventListener('click',function(){ track.scrollBy({left:(parseInt(btn.dataset.dir,10)||1)*Math.round(track.clientWidth*0.8),behavior:'smooth'}); });
      });
    });
    var lb=document.querySelector('[data-lightbox]');
    if(lb){
      var img=lb.querySelector('[data-lb-img]'), t=lb.querySelector('[data-lb-title]'), m=lb.querySelector('[data-lb-meta]');
      root.querySelectorAll('.fs-cert').forEach(function(b){
        b.addEventListener('click',function(){ img.src=b.dataset.full; img.alt=b.dataset.title; t.textContent=b.dataset.title; m.textContent=b.dataset.meta; lb.hidden=false; document.body.style.overflow='hidden'; });
      });
      function close(){ lb.hidden=true; document.body.style.overflow=''; }
      lb.addEventListener('click',function(e){ if(e.target===lb||e.target.classList.contains('fs-lb-close')) close(); });
      document.addEventListener('keydown',function(e){ if(e.key==='Escape') close(); });
    }
  })();
</script>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Founder Story",
  "settings": [],
  "presets": [{ "name": "Founder Story" }]
}
{% endschema %}
